    "lesson": 16,
    "title": [
        "A Campus Walking Tour (2)",
        "校园徒步参观（二）"
    ],
    "content": {
        "sentences": [
            [
                "Going across Edward Road, we arrive at the Student Union (SU).",
                "穿过爱德华路，我们到达了学生会（SU）。"
            ],
            [
                "There's a grocery store, a bank, and a bookshop on the ground floor.",
                "一楼有一家杂货店、一家银行和一家书店。"
            ],
            [
                "The restaurant on the first floor is popular among students where they can have a drink outside at the balcony and enjoy the pretty view of the campus.",
                "一楼的餐厅很受学生欢迎，他们可以在外面阳台喝点东西，欣赏校园的美丽景色。"
            ],
            [
                "Close to the SU, there's a large public square.",
                "靠近学生会，有一个大型公共广场。"
            ],
            [
                "It's sometimes crowded and noisy in the middle of the term when there are live campus sports events.",
                "学期中有时会有校园体育赛事直播，这时会拥挤嘈杂。"
            ],
            [
                "Walking through the square, you can see a grand building with a shining top.",
                "穿过广场，你可以看到一栋顶部闪闪发光的宏伟建筑。"
            ],
            [
                "Are you surprised that this is the largest art centre in the country?",
                "这是全国最大的艺术中心，你感到惊讶吗？"
            ],
            [
                "It contains two cinemas, two theatres, and a gallery.",
                "它包含两个电影院、两个剧院和一个画廊。"
            ],
            [
                "Now I'm going to show you the on-campus flats.",
                "现在我要带你们看看校内公寓。"
            ],
            [
                "There're nearly 1,000 rooms across four blocks.",
                "四栋楼有近1000个房间。"
            ],
            [
                "You can also live in hotels in the city centre, which is a few kilometres away.",
                "你也可以住在市中心的酒店，距离这里几公里。"
            ],
            [
                "There're many bus stations, and students can take buses to and from campus in all directions.",
                "有很多公交车站，学生可以乘坐公交车往返校园，通往各个方向。"
            ],
            [
                "We'll build the underground next year.",
                "我们明年将修建地铁。"
            ],
            [
                "In their spare time, students can visit close-by towns and villages with long histories.",
                "在业余时间，学生可以参观附近历史悠久的城镇和村庄。"
            ],
            [
                "There's a famous castle built in the 11th century which is not far away from here.",
                "有一座建于11世纪的著名城堡，距离这里不远。"
            ],
            [
                "The nearest railway station is only 800 metres away and the capital city is just an hour's train ride.",
                "最近的火车站只有800米远，到首都坐火车只需要一小时。"
            ],
            [
                "Within 20 minutes' drive, you can arrive at the airport.",
                "开车20分钟内就能到达机场。"
            ],
            [
                "By the way, there're two supermarkets, a department store, a hospital and a police station nearby so it is very convenient and safe to live here.",
                "顺便说一下，附近有两家超市、一家百货商店、一家医院和一家警察局，所以在这里生活非常方便和安全。"
            ],
            [
                "It is a great place for students to enjoy their university life in the busy city and peaceful countryside.",
                "对于学生来说，这是一个在繁忙城市和宁静乡村享受大学生活的好地方。"
            ]
        ]
    },
